Tests CMK lifecycle, cross‑account access, and end‑to‑end data protection in a multi‑tenant setup. It forces explicit rotation planning, policy scoping, and incident response readiness.

## Key Concepts
- Customer-managed CMK lifecycle per tenant
- IAM/KMS key policies and cross‑account grants
- Data re‑encryption workflow with minimal downtime
- Monitoring/auditing via CloudTrail and EventBridge

